---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Case studies" description="Reference deployments and validation work.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-20 pb-16 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-20 border-b border-ink-600">
    <p class="eyebrow">Case studies</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight">
      Early-stage, and honest about it.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-paper-300">
      We'd rather show you one real, verifiable reference deployment than a wall of logos we can't back
      up. Here's what's been validated so far, more will be added as pilot deployments complete.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="panel">
      <span class="status-chip ok">Reference deployment</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Simulated fleet, live flight environment</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-paper-300">
        A multi-drone reference deployment running the full pipeline against a live PX4/Gazebo flight
        simulation, with a real semantic-segmentation perception stack under audit and real flight
        telemetry feeding the sensor-health signals. The reliability score gates the flight controller
        directly, a confirmed fault triggers a real hold, not a log line.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-paper-100 border border-ink-600 pl-2 pr-3 py-1.5">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/logos/gazebo-logo.png`} alt="Gazebo" class="h-5 w-5" />
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-950">Gazebo</span>
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-paper-500 border border-ink-600 px-2.5 py-1.5">
          <i class="ti ti-drone text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i> PX4 SITL
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
        <div class="border-t border-ink-600 pt-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-500">Perception stack</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-paper-100">Classification + segmentation, real trained checkpoints</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink-600 pt-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-500">Environment</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-paper-100">Gazebo + PX4 SITL, real flight controller in the loop</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink-600 pt-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-500">Validation</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-paper-100">Controlled fault-injection benchmark, see technology page</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 sm:pb-28">
    <div class="panel">
      <span class="status-chip ok">Integration in progress</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">TayuTech, a FinEst Centre for Smart Cities (TalTech) pilot</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-paper-300">
        TayuTech is a publicly funded EU pilot programme (2025-2028) run by the FinEst Centre for Smart
        Cities under Tallinn University of Technology, equipping public service vehicles with modular
        sensor units for real-time urban monitoring, across pilot cities in Estonia, Ireland, and Croatia.
        Our SDK is being integrated into the road-infrastructure perception component, known as CitySense,
        the project's original name, running real-time road-surface-defect and manhole detection on
        camera footage from a moving vehicle, with the trust layer watching the perception model's outputs
        on real, unedited detections rather than a curated demo reel.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-paper-500">
        This is honestly an active technical integration, not a finished success story: the current
        milestone is correct, verified operation against real detection output, not yet a published
        detection-rate or fault-recovery result specific to this deployment. We'll update this page with
        real numbers once there are real numbers to share, not before.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-paper-100 border border-ink-600 px-3 py-2">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/logos/finest-logo.svg`} alt="FinEst Centre for Smart Cities" class="h-4" />
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-paper-100 border border-ink-600 px-3 py-1.5">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/logos/taltech-logo.png`} alt="TalTech" class="h-4" />
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-paper-500 border border-ink-600 px-2.5 py-1.5">
          <i class="ti ti-bus text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i> TayuTech
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
        <div class="border-t border-ink-600 pt-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-500">Perception stack</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-paper-100">Road-damage &amp; manhole detection, real trained checkpoints</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink-600 pt-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-500">Environment</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-paper-100">Moving-vehicle video, NVIDIA Jetson Orin edge target</div>
          <img
            src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/jetson-orin.png`}
            alt="NVIDIA Jetson Orin module, the edge deployment target for this integration"
            class="mt-3 w-full max-w-[220px] border border-ink-600"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink-600 pt-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-500">Programme</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-paper-100">FinEst Centre for Smart Cities, TalTech, publicly funded</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-ink-600">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Want to be the next one on this page?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-paper-300 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        We're looking for early pilot partners with a real perception stack in production or close to it.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/contact`} class="btn-primary">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
